.TH add 1  "add " 
.SH NAME
add \- Make `from` depend on `to`: `to` blocks `from`, so `from` stays blocked until `to` closes. Rejected if it would create a cycle
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBadd\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFROM\fR> <\fITO\fR> 
